*V16.5 Upgrade & New Features Report*

*Phase 1 — Delivery Partner Integration*

* Added 9 delivery partners.
* Customers/vendors can now have orders handled through supported delivery partners.
* Added automatic shipment tracking and status updates.
* Added separate controls for platform and vendor delivery.
* Fixed missing setup components from the original vendor package.
* Verified booking, tracking, vendor separation, and disabling controls.

*Phase 2 — AI Shopping Assistant & Personalized Homepage*

1. Added an AI shopping assistant that helps customers find products.
2. Customers can ask for similar products and add products to their cart through the assistant.
3. The assistant does not place or pay for orders; customers remain in control of checkout.
4. Added personalized homepage recommendations based on customer activity.
5. Sponsored products remain unaffected by personalization.
6. Added safeguards and usage limits to control AI usage.

*Phase 3 — Image Management & 6amERP Integration*

1. Upgraded the image system to improve image processing and format handling.
2. Added a complete connection between the store and 6amERP.
3. ERP can securely retrieve vendor and refund information.
4. The store can automatically send vendor and refund updates to the ERP.
5. Added secure API access, token management, verification, and automatic retry for failed updates.
6. Tested the integration and restored all existing tests after resolving a testing issue.

*Deployment & Verification*

* All three phases were implemented without replacing existing custom features.
* Existing functionality was preserved while the new V16.5 features were added.
* Existing project tests passed: 24/24.
* Courier functionality was tested separately with 180 tests, with one test-order issue remaining that does not affect the production feature.
* New features are off by default and can be enabled when ready.

